safe","s":"doors","a":1,"p":1413277686,"d":"The key has a label with \"SVU - safe in study\" on it","m":1,"i":"generic_key_alpha.png"},{"h":942398533,"n":"Östra Mark barn storage key","r":"key_doorkey_wm19","s":"doors","a":1,"p":1413277686,"d":"The key to the readiness storage at Östra Mark farm.","m":1,"i":"generic_key_alpha.png"},{"h":1541610115,"n":"A tracking device","r":"fnix_tracking_device","s":"mission","a":1,"p":485717896,"d":"A strange device that was attached to a flying Soviet machine. It seems to have gathered data from the machine, sending it to a set of coordinates in the North Coast.","m":1,"i":"fnix_tracking_device_alpha.png"},{"h":3202139670,"n":"Ammo crates","r":"exp02_sm090_ammo","s":"mission","a":1,"p":363622574,"d":"Ammo crates you scavenged from the Harvester in the convoy.","m":1,"i":"exp02_sm090_item_02_icon_alpha.png"},{"h":1425185004,"n":"Floppy disk","r":"key_doorkey_protokey","s":"mission","a":1,"p":1413277686,"d":"The program used to disable the gas flow regulator (Use with caution!)","m":1,"i":"generic_key_bunker_iff_alpha.png"},{"h":3860211700,"n":"FNIX armor plate 1","r":"key_rivkey_key01","s":"mission","a":1,"p":363622574,"d":"A piece of armor you looted off a FNIX Class Rival Tank.","m":1,"i":"exp02_mm040_item_02_icon_alpha.png"},{"h":1106438159,"n":"FNIX armor plate 2","r":"key_rivkey_key02","s":"mission","a":1,"p":363622574,"d":"A piece of armor you looted off a FNIX Class Rival Tank.","m":1,"i":"exp02_mm040_item_02_icon_alpha.png"},{"h":1455530903,"n":"FNIX armor plate 3","r":"key_rivkey_key03","s":"mission","a":1,"p":363622574,"d":"A piece of armor you looted off a FNIX Class Rival Tank.","m":1,"i":"exp02_mm040_item_02_icon_alpha.png"},{"h":1734537092,"n":"Mysterious transcription","r":"exp02_sm080_document","s":"mission","a":1,"p":363622574,"d":"This document retrieved from the dumping station at Brevikens Camping is a transcription of a Morse code transmission and contains the following text:\n\n\"DECEMBER 25 1989\n\nYELLOW REINDEER\n\nOPERATION LYNX IS A GO. PENDING FINAL ORDERS FROM COMMANDER IN CHIEF. GROUND DEPLOYMENT ON SWEDISH SOIL IMMINENT.\nAWAIT FURTHER ORDERS.\n\nMERRY CHRISTMAS\"","m":1,"i":"exp02_sm080_item_03_icon_alpha.png"},{"h":66927541,"n":"Pile of ropes","r":"exp02_sm080_rope","s":"mission","a":1,"p":363622574,"d":"Scavenged from one of the Harvester dumping stations at Brevikens Camping. The survivors at the Ringfort will put those to good use to maintain the defense perimeter you built for them.","m":1,"i":"exp02_mm020_item_03_icon_alpha.png"},{"h":2914259160,"n":"Tank vision module","r":"exp02_mm100_key","s":"mission","a":1,"p":363622574,"d":"A vision module you looted off the destroyed Rival. You can use it on the scanner at the entrance of the FNIX facility.","m":1,"i":"exp02_mm100_item_01_icon_alpha.png"},{"h":2097422380,"n":"Wood logs","r":"exp02_sm080_log","s":"mission","a":1,"p":363622574,"d":"Scavenged from one of the Harvester dumping stations at Brevikens Camping. The survivors at the Ringfort will put those to good use to maintain the defense perimeter you built for them.","m":1,"i":"exp02_mm020_item_04_icon_alpha.png"}]}